docs {
  ## Get Job by ID — Public
  
  Returns a single job by its UUID with owner and category.
  View counter is auto-incremented on each fetch.
  Replace `JOB_UUID` with the actual job ID.
  
  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "...",
      "title": "...",
      "slug": "...",
      "views": 1,
      "owner": { ... },
      "category": { ... },
      "type": "FULLTIME",
      "budget": "$3000 - $5000",
      "deadline": "2026-08-15T00:00:00Z",
      ...
    }
  }
  ```
}
